  "description": "Keep IntentSharp model calls in JSON or YAML files: the instruction, the result shape, the rules and the examples. Your code names the intent, each answer is checked against the file's rules, the catalog reloads when a file changes while the application runs, and every run is tagged with the intent's name and version. Commercial software with a free 30-day evaluation; business and production use need a paid license (intentsharp.com/pricing).",
